{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門安定邨清晨發生傷人案。<br/></p><p>警方在清晨4時許接報，一名46歲男子指，9歲女兒在定泰樓單位內，情緒激動並企圖用刀自殘，他嘗試制止期間，傷及女兒胸口。女童清醒送往屯門醫院治理。警方暫列傷人案跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T03:24:13.763211+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T02:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T03:58:15.492744+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T03:18:12.918665+00:00","content_hash":"2f16cc8627db81ab8081bc523158af35e947ffc638d47fb8c6ddb48ed28d8338","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}